OL,3,GNEWSA'Absolutely disgusting and sick':
OL,4,APolice investigate pigs' heads in
OL,5,Apublic park
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn incident where pig heads were put in
OL,8,Fa public park early on Saturday morning
OL,9,Fhas been described as "disgusting and
OL,10,Fsick" by a local councillor.
OL,12,FThe heads, including one impaled on a
OL,13,Fwooden stick, appeared in Kilbroney
OL,14,FPark in Rostrevor, County Down,
OL,15,Faccompanied by a sign that said "here
OL,16,Fpiggy piggy".
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
