OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Absolutely disgusting and sick':
OL,4,APolice investigate pigs' heads in
OL,5,Apublic park
OL,6,
OL,7,FIndependent councillor Mark Gibbons
OL,8,Fsaid it was "absolutely disgusting and
OL,9,Fsick" that somebody would go to "great
OL,10,Flengths" to do this, especially on a
OL,11,Fweekend where young families would be
OL,12,Fenjoying the Halloween break.
OL,14,FThe PSNI confirmed they are
OL,15,Finvestigating the incident and are
OL,16,Fkeeping an open mind as to the
OL,17,Fmotivation behind this report and
OL,18,Fconsidering all potential lines of
OL,19,Fenquiry.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
